{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】警方在佐敦截查一輛私家車，檢獲毒品拘捕司機。</p>\n<p>涉案男子在警車上協助調查。警方晚上7時在佐敦道與德興街交界發現一輛私家車車頭損毀，司機形跡可疑，於是上前截查，在車廂內發現多包懷疑毒品，包括依托咪酯煙彈及可卡因，當場拘捕司機。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:21:57.555647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:07:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:48.440506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:48.440506+00:00","content_hash":"3ae1a87756019bb2e2fe51fb0e2de9f3d9b345d379a5a437b306b4736ae41c94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}